Original commit body from 8bf9ff8:

Replace the fragile regex-based approach for adding [IGNORING TESTS]
markers to section headers with a cleaner _section_header() helper
function that generates the marker at header creation time.

This avoids issues with the regex matching bash comments inside code
blocks (like "## --->" in shell scripts).

Changes:
- Add _section_header(title, exclude_tests) helper function
- Update all _format_* functions to accept exclude_tests parameter
- Pass exclude_tests to format function call sites in generate_sketch
- Remove regex post-processing that was matching content incorrectly
